cff-version: 1.2.0
version: 0.1.0
message: "Please cite this research software by its version-specific Zenodo DOI once released, and cite the original PhysioNet dataset independently where relevant."
type: software
title: "GPU-Accelerated Causal Machine Learning: Reproducible Benchmarks for Decision-Time Reliability and Synthetic Antibiotic-Timing Research"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible scientific software for temporal data-integrity audits, simulation-based
  causal estimation, synthetic individualized treatment-start risk curves, and matched
  CPU/CUDA experiments. A Google Colab Tesla T4 benchmark measured faster identical-weight
  inference for a synthetic workload. The public MIMIC-IV-ED Demo analysis audits
  documentation timestamps only; no patient-level causal antibiotic effects or clinical
  treatment policies have been established.
authors:
